      "name": "AjayBot Heartbeat Check",
      "prompt": "You are a silent watchdog. Check whether AjayBot GitHub Actions workflows are running on time, using direct GitHub API calls via Python (execute_code or terminal).\n\nSTEPS:\n1. In Python: token = os.environ.get(\"GITHUB_TOKEN\"). If missing → REPLY EXACTLY: '⚠️ Heartbeat check error: no GITHUB_TOKEN' and stop.\n2. For each workflow file in [\"ajaybot-paper.yml\", \"ajaybot-monitor.yml\"]:\n   GET https://api.github.com/repos/nothing12837-lang/ajaybot/actions/workflows/{workflow_file}/runs?per_page=1\n   headers: Authorization: token <GITHUB_TOKEN>, Accept: application/vnd.github.v3+json\n3. Parse latest run's created_at. If BOTH workflows' latest runs are older than 6 hours → REPLY EXACTLY: '⚠️ AjayBot workflow delayed! Check GitHub Actions.'\n4. If any latest run is fresher than 6 hours → REPLY EXACTLY: 'ALL_OK'\n5. On any HTTP error → REPLY EXACTLY: '⚠️ Heartbeat check error: HTTP <code>'\n\nNEVER print the token. Keep reply to one line only.",
